# Save the Children (battlefield.save_the_children): a party. Four level 75 Warriors of San d'Oria by Hut_Door: main
# with 1-3 current at Status 2 (the registrant), bob with 1-3 completed (a helper), cid with 1-3 current at Status 1,
# dan with no mission (GMs). main leads bob and cid. main's menu, area 1: registered; onEntryEventUpdate registers the
# party members in the zone (the clearance copied, registerBattlefield); main enters. bob, holding the clearance:
# onEntryTrigger's entered-party arm: checkRequirements as no registrant (completed): the menu (enterExisting 1);
# updated: entered (checkSkipCutscene: completed: skippable). cid, holding it: checkRequirements fails (Status 1, below
# 2): nothing; cid's trade: the clearance held: WAIT_LONGER. dan joins after the registration (no clearance): his
# trigger: a member holds one, dan none registered: PARTY_MEMBERS_ARE_ENGAGED; his trade: a member holds one:
# WAIT_LONGER. main claims a Fodderchief: its enmity locks the battlefield; onBattlefieldStatusChange (LOCKED, once:
# statusRemoval 1) takes the clearance from the members outside it (cid). cid's trigger: no clearance, a member holds
# one, cid registered and the battlefield not open: CLEARED_BUT_MEMBERS_ENGAGED. The three killed: won; 32001 to main
# (1-3 current: battlefieldWin 32, canSkipCS 0) and to bob (completed, not current: no battlefieldWin, canSkipCS 1);
# main's finish: 1-3's handler (the key, the title, Status 3); bob's: nothing.
lists GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrigger GhelsbaOutpost/Hut_Door/onTrade GhelsbaOutpost/onEventUpdate/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32000 GhelsbaOutpost/onEventFinish/32001
char zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char bob zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char cid zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
char dan zone=GhelsbaOutpost pos=-163.5,-11.7,77.8 job=WAR lvl=75 nation=0
mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
bob: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
bob: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
bob: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren completed
cid: mission Sandoria SmashTheOrcishScouts completed
cid: mission Sandoria BatHunt completed
cid: mission Sandoria SaveTheChildren current
dan: item ChunkOfCopperOre
cid: item ChunkOfCopperOre
login
missionstatus Sandoria 2                # a GM
bob: login
cid: login
cid: missionstatus Sandoria 1           # a GM
dan: login
invite bob
bob: accept
invite cid
cid: accept
trigger Hut_Door                        # the menu 32000
update 32000 option=1                   # registered in area 1; bob and cid registered with it
finish                                  # main entered
bob: trigger Hut_Door                   # bob's clearance: no registrant, completed: the menu (enterExisting)
bob: update 32000 option=1              # entered (skippable)
bob: finish
cid: trigger Hut_Door                   # cid's clearance: Status 1: checkRequirements fails: nothing
cid: trade Hut_Door ChunkOfCopperOre x1 # the clearance held: WAIT_LONGER
invite dan
dan: accept
dan: trigger Hut_Door                   # no clearance, a member's: PARTY_MEMBERS_ARE_ENGAGED
dan: trade Hut_Door ChunkOfCopperOre x1 # a member's clearance: WAIT_LONGER
tick 2000                               # the Fodderchiefs spawn
claim FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK                # its enmity: LOCKED; the clearance taken from cid
tick 1000
cid: trigger Hut_Door                   # registered, the battlefield locked: CLEARED_BUT_MEMBERS_ENGAGED
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+1
kill FODDERCHIEF_VOKDEK+2               # won: 32001 to main and bob
finish                                  # 1-3: the key, the title, Status 3
bob: finish                             # bob: nothing
